  "technicalNotes": [
    "All geometry positions and UVs remain Float32. Normal and tangent directions use glTF-normalized signed Int8 through KHR_mesh_quantization, supported natively by GLTFLoader without decoder.",
    "Any offline CPU exporter must expand normalized BufferAttributes using getComponent/getX/Y/Z before writing Float32 arrays.",
    "No Draco or Meshopt decoder, no external textures required by GLBs.",
    "GLB prototypes are borrowed assets. Clone scene or materials only when modifying them. Mid tree uses hero materials by name on clones.",
    "The textures are photogrammetric authored material maps; use white/neutral runtime baseColor to avoid unintended color multiplication.",
    "Runtime filenames retain their source identifiers; external diffuse/normal JPGs and transparent impostors are now 512px.",
    "Embedded GLB color/normal images are 512px; packed roughness/occlusion images are 256px. All authored geometry, UVs, material names and mesh transforms are preserved.",
    "Provider uses the material-preserving 4500-triangle tree LOD for the nearby trees, with 20 nearby tree instances and crossed photographed impostors beyond. Full-detail tree GLB supplies the borrowed authored material library.",
    "Asset URLs use ?v=coast-perf10 to invalidate earlier large cached variants."
  ],
